If you got the rogue clone source, but do not have random() and srandom()
on your system, here is the file random.c with the source to the 4.2 bsd
random number generator included.  You should not attempt to replace
random() and srandom() with rand() and srand() unless you have reason to
believe they work better than the versions I'm familiar with, which are
not sufficiently random for this game.
The following code is intended mainly for 4.1 bsd users, but may be
applicable elsewhere.  If you already have random() and srandom() on your
system, don't use this stuff, all it would give you is compiler errors
about re-declarations.

